# Drivers Directory

This directory contains user-facing workflow drivers.

Each driver should have:
- manifest.yaml  - Input/output declaration
- driver.py      - Implementation
- verify.py      - Outcome verification
- README.md      - Usage documentation

Commands every driver must support:
- plan     - Show what would be done
- dry-run  - Execute reads, preview writes
- execute  - Run the workflow
- verify   - Confirm the outcome
- rollback - Reverse changes if possible

See docs/architecture.md for driver guidelines.
